+## 🚀 Deploy
+
+The template is prebuilt HTML and CSS, so it can be served as-is. The `Staticfile` tells Wasmer Edge to serve the repository root as a static site. To host your own copy, fork this repository and import your fork; the button below opens the Wasmer import page for this repository and does not copy it into your GitHub account.
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=TailGrids%2Fplay-tailwind)
+
 ## 📃 License
 
 Play is an open-source template, you can use it with your personal or commercial projects without any attribution or backlink.
diff --git a/Staticfile b/Staticfile
